      "released_at": "2026-10-08T15:03:02Z",
      "channel": "Stable",
      "release_notes": "**Changes:**\r\n- Add support for automatically relocating episode sidecar files (`.nfo`, `.xml`, images) and attachment folders\r\n- Relocate series-level assets (`Theme.mp3`, loose images, unmatched/ignored videos, and loose folders) when vacating a destination folder\r\n- Prevent data loss by never overwriting existing files at the destination\r\n- Safely clean up empty source directories from the bottom up after relocation\r\n- Fix race conditions with Shoko core during video hashing and concurrent directory deletions\r\n- Increase the sidecar relocation polling timeout to 5 minutes to fully support slow cross-drive migrations\r\n- Tolerate symlinks gracefully during folder scanning and relocation\r\n- Migrate logging to `Microsoft.Extensions.Logging` to natively integrate with Shoko's log system\r\n- Optimize regex performance and string manipulation using modern .NET features\r\n- Update README with expanded file naming explanations and sidecar documentation\r\n- Bump Shoko.Abstractions to v6.0.0-alpha.100\r\n\r\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/natyusha/ShokoRenamerNN/compare/v1.0.2...v1.0.3",
